<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>疹 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%96%B9/</link><description>Recent content in 疹 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 15:24:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%96%B9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>诸真人传授儿科：痘疮计日 痘疮坏病 疹</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-32-chuanshouerke/</link><pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 15:21:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/5-32-chuanshouerke/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“诸真人传授儿科”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;痘疮（天花）与麻疹&lt;/strong&gt;的辨治法则。由&lt;strong&gt;岐天师&lt;/strong&gt;传痘疮逐日五方，&lt;strong&gt;秦真人、雷真君&lt;/strong&gt;各传痘疮坏症急救方，&lt;strong&gt;岐天师&lt;/strong&gt;又传疹症通治方。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;痘疮初起当以补气补血为君，佐以发散，使重者轻、轻者少，切忌寒凉劫散；坏症乃气虚火不能发，当大补元气、解毒透邪，可起死回生；疹症以清热凉血、透发解毒为法&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>